# flexWrap migration working cache (migrate-container-flexwrap-and-stack-candidates.py)
# Each posts-dump-*.json is a FULL copy of every post's content on the canary
# (~500 KB a run, 2.1 MB after one session). They are a regenerable cache — the
# script rebuilds them with --pull — and an untracked file is invisible to a
# git-based dirty gate while still being visible to tar, so leaving them loose
# is the shape of a real past incident here.
reports/flexwrap-migration/

