# Phase 5a (2026-05-22) — WP style-variation overlay system retired.
# Per-client snapshots now live at sites/<client>/theme-snapshot.json.
# theme/sgs-theme/styles/ is no longer used for variation JSONs.
# Stage 0.7 of /sgs-clone still writes to theme/sgs-theme/styles/<client>.css
# as a pipeline intermediate — see parking entry P-5A-CLIENT-VARIATION-CSS-PATH.
# Ignore the whole directory until the orchestrator relocates to pipeline-state/.
theme/sgs-theme/styles/*.json
theme/sgs-theme/styles/*.css
theme/sgs-theme/styles/colours/
theme/sgs-theme/styles/typography/

